# Line endings: LF for every text file, on every OS.
#
# Why: Flutter writes its generated files (linux/, macos/, windows/ plugin
# registrants, l10n, lock files) with LF. On Windows, Git's autocrlf turns
# files into CRLF, so after every `flutter run` / `flutter pub get` those
# files showed up as "modified" with no real change. With this file they
# stay LF and stop appearing in `git status`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts must keep CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary files: never touch them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
